      "Type": "PIP",
      "Language": "eng",
      "AbstractText": "This article discusses a case report about late complications caused by an IUD. Strangulation of the ileus by an IUD represents a rare event when the closed IUD has perforated partially. A pelvic roentgenographic examination alone is not sufficient in order to give an estimate of the position of the IUD. Results of hysterography and ultrasound must be taken into account as well. (author's modified)"
